  m_Name: New QR Code Data 13
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SafetyTraining.QRCodeData
  qrCodeID: "Yard\u0131mc\u0131 Topraklama G\xF6stergesi"
  title: "Yard\u0131mc\u0131 Topraklama G\xF6stergesi"
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "Yard\u0131mc\u0131 Topraklama G\xF6stergesi, yard\u0131mc\u0131 topraklama
    ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n do\u011Fru \u015Fekilde yap\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6sterir. Yard\u0131mc\u0131 topraklama kaz\u0131\u011F\u0131 ile ara\xE7
    aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011Flant\u0131 sistem taraf\u0131ndan s\xFCrekli kontrol
    edilir. Ba\u011Flant\u0131n\u0131n uygun olmamas\u0131 veya topraklama direncinin
    g\xFCvenli s\u0131n\u0131rlar d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda olmas\u0131 durumunda sistem
    g\xFCvenlik amac\u0131yla y\xFCksek gerilim testinin ba\u015Flat\u0131lmas\u0131na
    izin vermez. Bu g\xF6sterge, test \xF6ncesinde yard\u0131mc\u0131 topraklama
    ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n do\u011Frulanmas\u0131 i\xE7in kullan\u0131lan
    \xF6nemli g\xFCvenlik g\xF6stergelerinden biridir."
